        "content": "<p>ChihweiLHBird opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14532\">PR #14532</a> from <code>ChihweiLHBird:wasi-nn-onnx-input-errors</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The ONNX backend panics the host for an input tensor whose type is not <code>f32</code>, and for an <code>f32</code> tensor whose byte length is not a multiple of four. This change returns a <code>BackendError</code> in both cases and adds tests for the byte length check on the WIT and WITX paths.</p>\n</blockquote>",
